<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN"><head>
<meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; script-src 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; frame-src about:; connect-src 'none'; img-src data:">
<title>Web Flow · 当前源码交互预览</title>
<style>/* SOURCE_STYLES */
html,body{height:auto;min-height:100%;overflow:auto;color-scheme:light}body{display:block;background:var(--od-paper);color:var(--od-ink)}
.preview{max-width:1040px;margin:auto;padding:24px;display:grid;gap:16px}.preview h1{font-size:20px;margin:0}.preview p{margin:0}
.preview-layout{display:flex;gap:32px;align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:wrap}.preview-device{margin:0;width:360px;max-width:100%;flex:none}
.preview-device figcaption{margin-bottom:8px}.preview-device iframe{display:block;width:100%;height:800px;border:1px solid var(--od-line);border-radius:var(--radius-surface);background:var(--od-paper)}
.preview-lab{flex:1;min-width:240px;display:grid;gap:16px}.preview-controls{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}
.preview-controls .od-field{width:auto;min-height:44px}.preview-controls label{display:grid;gap:4px}.preview-controls button{min-height:44px}
.preview details{padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--od-line);border-radius:var(--radius-surface)}.preview details>summary{min-height:32px;cursor:pointer}
@media(max-width:600px){.preview{padding:12px}.preview-device{margin-inline:auto}.preview-layout{gap:20px}.preview-lab{min-width:0;width:100%}}
</style></head><body><main class="preview">
<h1>Web Flow 交互预览</h1>
<p class="od-note">当前产品源码 · 可实际操作 · 仅模拟数据。运行与授权、状态详情及应用页面均来自同一份真实实现。</p>
<div class="preview-layout">
<figure class="preview-device" id="preview-device"><figcaption><strong>当前候选</strong> <span class="od-note" id="preview-size">360 px · 浅色应用</span></figcaption>
<iframe id="candidate" title="当前源码：完整 Web Flow" sandbox="allow-scripts"></iframe></figure>
<aside class="preview-lab" aria-label="预览辅助区（不属于产品 UI）">
<div class="preview-controls" role="group" aria-label="预览视图">
<button class="od-button" id="preview-home">首页</button><button class="od-button" id="preview-task">当前任务</button><button class="od-button" id="preview-scope">任务授权</button>
</div>
<div class="preview-controls">
<label>预览宽度<select id="preview-width" class="od-field"><option value="320">320 px</option><option value="360" selected>360 px</option></select></label>
<label>应用主题<select id="preview-theme" class="od-field"><option value="light">浅色</option><option value="dark">深色</option></select></label>
</div>
<p class="od-note" id="preview-feedback" role="status">直接点击左侧界面。开关与授权只写本页内存；切换页面不清除草稿。</p>
<details><summary>模拟状态与来源</summary>
<div class="od-stack">
<p class="od-note">辅助控件只改变预览内存，不属于产品。切换状态会改变当前模拟任务；重置会清除本页模拟草稿。</p>
<div class="preview-controls">
<label>自动运行<select id="lab-enabled" class="od-field"><option value="true">开启</option><option value="false">关闭</option></select></label>
<label>任务状态<select id="lab-task" class="od-field"><option value="empty">空闲</option><option value="draft">草稿未发送</option><option value="waiting">等待回复</option><option value="no-candidate">无任务候选</option><option value="pending">待批准</option><option value="running">运行中</option><option value="success">已完成</option><option value="failed">具体错误</option><option value="unknown">结果未知</option><option value="combined-error">未知并有错误</option></select></label>
<label>连接<select id="lab-listener" class="od-field"><option value="ready">监听就绪</option><option value="disconnected">需要恢复</option><option value="error">读取失败</option></select></label>
<label>授权<select id="lab-auth" class="od-field"><option value="approved">已批准</option><option value="none">未批准</option><option value="revoked">已撤销</option><option value="invalid">安装变化</option><option value="error">读取失败</option><option value="loading">读取中</option><option value="save-fail">下次保存失败</option></select></label>
<button id="lab-reset" class="od-button">重置模拟数据与草稿</button>
</div>
<p class="od-note">网络、真实任务、Chrome、Native、安装与网站权限均不可用。宿主五 Tab 仅作上下文，管理图标不可用；复制仅写内存。系统 Chrome、读屏、Native、production：NOT_TESTED。</p>
<p class="od-technical">来源：<!-- SOURCE_REVISION -->。从 build-design.mjs 重建，check-design.mjs 检查。SHA 见同名 manifest。旧版排版比较不参与当前候选。</p>
</div></details>
</aside></div></main>
<script id="webflow-preview-sources" type="application/json">/* SOURCE_DOCUMENTS */</script><script>/* PREVIEW_BEHAVIOR */</script>
</body></html>
